# Cloudflare Pages — custom response headers.
# Caching is deliberately left to Cloudflare's defaults: filenames are not
# content-hashed, so a long max-age would serve stale photos for weeks
# after a menu or gallery update.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
